    <h1>Rotel Dip Recipe</h1>
    <h2>Classic 3 Ingredient Rotel Dip</h2>

    <h3>Ingredients</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>1 can (10 oz) <strong>Ro*Tel</strong> Diced Tomatoes & Green Chilies</li>
        <li>16 oz block <strong>Velveeta</strong> Original Cheese, cubed</li>
        <li>1 lb lean ground beef (or sausage)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Instructions</h3>
    <dl>
        <dt>Step 1</dt>
        <dd>Brown the ground beef in a large skillet over medium-high heat until no pink remains.</dd>

        <dt>Step 2</dt>
        <dd>Drain off any excess grease from the pan.</dd>

        <dt>Step 3</dt>
        <dd>Reduce the heat to medium-low and add the cubed Velveeta cheese and the entire can of RoTel (including the liquid) to the skillet.</dd>

        <dt>Step 4</dt>
        <dd>Stir constantly until the cheese is completely melted and the dip is smooth and creamy.</dd>

        <dt>Step 5</dt>
        <dd>Serve warm with tortilla chips or crackers.</dd>
    </dl>

